note 0 C3 8 100
note 0 G3 8 100
note 0 C4 8 100
note 0 E4 8 100
note 8 A2 8 110
note 8 E3 8 110
note 8 A3 8 110
note 8 C4 8 110
note 8 E4 8 110
param p2 240 16
note 16 F3 8 90
note 16 A3 8 90
note 16 C4 8 90
note 16 F4 8 90
expect sound 0 24
expect idle 70
expect peak_below -2
